# Motion: Full in the Play view: a queen's move between two cards (L-2 d1 to L-1 c2) flies from one card to the other along an arc (captured
# mid-flight), the new boards grow in, and a refused click shakes its card in place.
# Settings layout: Settings (150,490); Display tab (880,172); Motion toggle (200,308); Back (125,25).
wait 20
click 150 490
wait 30
click 880 172
wait 20
click 200 308        # Motion: Reduced -> Full
wait 10
click 125 25
wait 30
startplayview on
record ../records/play-view-6tl.5dr
wait 120
clicksq -2 8 d1
wait 30
clicksq -1 8 c2
wait 3
capture motion-play-view-f3
wait 6
capture motion-play-view-f9
wait 10
capture motion-play-view-f19
wait 60
clicksq 0 9 e7       # a piece of the other side: refused, its card shakes
wait 3
capture motion-play-view-shake
wait 60
